{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594280/extras/5494c93432056dd5343def6b3be793fe.avif?t=1760517775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594280/extras_big/5494c93432056dd5343def6b3be793fe.avif?t=1760517775 width=800 height=160 /></span><strong>AVTale\u00a0</strong>\u2013 is an exciting cooperative 2D platformer designed <strong>for two players</strong> on a <strong>single screen (Split Screen)\u00a0locally and online</strong>, where teamwork is the key to escaping a bottomless cave where echoes of ancient mysteries blend with the whispers of shadows. The game features a dark-toned atmosphere where lighting plays a crucial role and offers dynamic battles, challenging puzzles, and a world filled with dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594280/extras/cc6fd828527257a3d26bb9d259ae60b5.avif?t=1760517775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594280/extras_big/cc6fd828527257a3d26bb9d259ae60b5.avif?t=1760517775 width=800 height=160 /></span><strong>Co-op as the Key to Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built to emphasize the importance of player interaction. One player takes on the role of support, using healing, shields, and buffs, while the other focuses on offense, fighting enemies. Only through teamwork can they succeed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594280/extras/8e8b1f5f221960592a9a19ef4310d92d.poster.avif?t=1760517775\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594280/extras/8e8b1f5f221960592a9a19ef4310d92d.webm?t=1760517775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594280/extras/8e8b1f5f221960592a9a19ef4310d92d.mp4?t=1760517775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op</strong> - fight with your friends online!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split screen co-op gameplay</strong> \u2013 play together on one PC using gamepads or keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two unique playstyles</strong> \u2013 support and attack, combine your strengths!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging puzzles</strong> \u2013 requiring coordination and teamwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic combat</strong> \u2013 numerous respawning monsters and real-time battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric world</strong> \u2013 a dark, mysterious cave with stunning locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A survival story</strong> \u2013 the heroes search for an exit and discover a magical stone that guides them forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-based challenge</strong> \u2013 each level is played against the clock, pushing players to act quickly and efficiently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance comparison</strong> \u2013 at the end of the game, players find out which style dominated: the steadfast warrior or the devoted protector.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to trust your partner and escape the darkness?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Help!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3594280/1a2787cd67e573a302c320b38aacd1547220bfd2.jpg"},{"name":"FIRST BLOOD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps